CHAPTER.VERS:
You speak also to the sons of Israel, saying, Truly you

          {+}
         will keep my Sabbaths: for it is a sign between me and you

          {+}
         throughout your

          {+}
         generations; that you

          {+}
         may know that I am Yahweh who sanctifies you

          {+}
        .

You

          {+}
         will keep the Sabbath therefore; for it is holy to you

          {+}
        : everyone who profanes it will surely be put to death; for whoever does any work in it, that soul will be cut off from among his people.
